            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wazawa wafuatao wa makuhani walikuwa na tarumbeta: Zekaria, mwana wa Yonathani, mwana wa Shemaya aliyekuwa mwana wa Matania, mwana wa Mikaya, mwana wa Zakuri, mwana wa Asafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndugu zake wafuatao waliimba kwa ala za muziki za mfalme Daudi, mtu wa Mungu, yaani Shemaya, Azareli, Milalai, Gilalai, Maai, Nethaneli, Yuda na Hanani, walitanguliwa na Ezra mwandishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwenye Lango la Chemchemi walipanda ngazi kuelekea mji wa Daudi, wakaipita Ikulu ya Daudi, na kuelekea nyuma kwenye ukuta hadi kwenye Lango la Maji, mashariki ya mji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kundi lingine lililoimba nyimbo za shukrani lilielekea upande wa kushoto juu ya ukuta. Mimi nilifuatana na kundi hili pamoja na nusu ya watu. Tulipitia Mnara wa Tanuri hadi kwenye Ukuta Mpana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kutoka hapo, tulipitia Lango la Efraimu, Lango la Yeshana, Lango la Samaki, Mnara wa Hananeli, Mnara wa Mia Moja mpaka kwenye Lango la Kondoo. Tulimalizia maandamano yetu kwenye Lango la Gereza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo, makundi yote mawili yaliyokuwa yanaimba nyimbo za shukrani yalisimama katika nyumba ya Mungu, pamoja nami na nusu ya viongozi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hata na makuhani waliokuwa na tarumbeta: Eliakimu, Maaseya, Miniamini, Mikaya, Eliehoenai, Zekaria na Hanania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hao walifuatwa na Maaseya, Shemaya, Eleazari, Uzi, Yehohanani, Malkiya, Elamu na Ezeri. Waimbaji waliimba wakiongozwa na Yezrahia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
